    <div id="cphPrimaryContent_cphTabContent_pnlSummary">
		
        <div class="row mb-2">
            <div class="col-12"><h2 class="section-h mb-4">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Latest Earnings Summary</h2></div><div class="col-12"><div class="row"><div class="col-12  mb-2 mb-lg-0"><dl class="row justify-content-center align-items-stretch mb-0"><div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center align-content-center w-100 py-1 border rounded mb-3 text-center stat-summary-wrapper py-1 earnings-wrapper"><dt class="stat-summary-title mb-1">Actual EPS <br/> (Oct. 17) </dt><dd class="stat-summary-heading my-1 c-green ">$1.94 <span class="stat-summary-subheading mt-1 mx-auto c-green">Beat By $0.20 </span></dd></div><div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center align-content-center w-100 py-1 border rounded mb-3 text-center stat-summary-wrapper py-1 earnings-wrapper"><dt class="stat-summary-title mb-1">Consensus EPS <br/> (Oct. 17) </dt><dd class="stat-summary-heading my-1">$1.74 <span class="stat-summary-subheading mt-1 mx-auto"></span></dd></div></dl></div></div><p style="line-height:1.5;">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing released Q3 2024 earnings on October 17, 2024, reporting an EPS of <strong>$1.94</strong>, which topped analysts' consensus estimates of <strong>$1.74</strong> by <strong> <span class="cgreen">$0.20</span></strong>. Quarterly revenue was reported to be <strong>$23.50 billion</strong>, above analyst estimates of <strong>$22.72 billion</strong>.  With a trailing EPS of <em>$6.24</em> and a P/E Ratio of <em>32.21</em>, Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's earnings are expected to grow <em>27.12%</em> next year, from <strong>$6.97</strong> to <strong>$8.86</strong> per share. </p></div>
        </div>
    
	</div>
	<div id="cphPrimaryContent_cphTabContent_pnlOptin" onkeypress="javascript:return WebForm_FireDefaultButton(event, &#39;cphPrimaryContent_cphTabContent_threeLineSignup&#39;)">
		
        <div class="mb-4 mx-0 row border-top border-bottom pr-2 py-2 align-items-center" style="font-size: 1rem; border-color: var(--gray-3); clear: both;">
            <div class="col-md-6 pl-0 pr-0 pr-md-1 mb-1 mb-md-0">
                <div class="c-blue h3">
                    Get Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Earnings Alerts
                </div>
                <p>
                    Want to stay updated on the latest earnings announcements and upcoming reports? Sign up for <strong>Earnings360's daily newsletter</strong> to receive timely earnings updates on Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing and other key companies, straight to your inbox.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 px-0 mx-0 row form-row font-small pl-md-5">
