            <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage" class="lh-medium pb-3 pr-md-3"><h2 class="mb-4">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Earnings - Frequently Asked Questions</h2><dl class="faq-accordion-list"><div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question1" itemprop="name text" class="expand-question m-0 position-relative"><button class="collapsed py-3 pl-0 pr-4" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#answer-wrapper1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-wrapper1">When did Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing announce their last quarterly earnings?<i class="fa-regular fa-square-minus accordion-state-open-icon c-blue-8" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-regular fa-square-plus accordion-state-closed-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></dt>
<dd itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" id="answer-wrapper1" class="collapse multi-collapse ml-3"><div><div class="py-2 px-3">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer1">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) last announced its quarterly earning data on Thursday, October 17, 2024. <a href="/stocks/NYSE/TSM/earnings/" class="sr-only sr-only-focusable">Learn more on TSM's earnings history.</a></p>
</div></div></dd>
</div>
<div class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question2" class="expand-question m-0 position-relative"><button class="collapsed py-3 pl-0 pr-4" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#answer-wrapper2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-wrapper2">What guidance has Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing issued on next quarter's earnings?<i class="fa-regular fa-square-minus accordion-state-open-icon c-blue-8" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-regular fa-square-plus accordion-state-closed-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></dt>
<dd id="answer-wrapper2" class="collapse multi-collapse ml-3"><div><div class="py-2 px-3">
<p id="answer2">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing issued an update on its fourth quarter 2024 earnings guidance on Thursday, October, 17th. The company issued revenue guidance of $26.1 billion-$26.9 billion, compared to the consensus revenue estimate of $24.9 billion.</p>
</div></div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question3" itemprop="name text" class="expand-question m-0 position-relative"><button class="collapsed py-3 pl-0 pr-4" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#answer-wrapper3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-wrapper3">Did Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing beat their earnings estimates last quarter?<i class="fa-regular fa-square-minus accordion-state-open-icon c-blue-8" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-regular fa-square-plus accordion-state-closed-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></dt>
<dd itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" id="answer-wrapper3" class="collapse multi-collapse ml-3"><div><div class="py-2 px-3">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer3">In the previous quarter, Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) reported $1.94 earnings per share (EPS) to beat the analysts' consensus estimate of $1.74 by $0.20. <a href="/stocks/NYSE/TSM/earnings/" class="sr-only sr-only-focusable">Learn more on analysts' earnings estimate vs. TSM's actual earnings.</a></p>
</div></div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question4" itemprop="name text" class="expand-question m-0 position-relative"><button class="collapsed py-3 pl-0 pr-4" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#answer-wrapper4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-wrapper4">How much revenue does Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing generate each year?<i class="fa-regular fa-square-minus accordion-state-open-icon c-blue-8" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-regular fa-square-plus accordion-state-closed-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></dt>
<dd itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" id="answer-wrapper4" class="collapse multi-collapse ml-3"><div><div class="py-2 px-3">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer4">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) has a recorded annual revenue of $69.30 billion.</p>
</div></div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question5" itemprop="name text" class="expand-question m-0 position-relative"><button class="collapsed py-3 pl-0 pr-4" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#answer-wrapper5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-wrapper5">How much profit does Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing generate each year?<i class="fa-regular fa-square-minus accordion-state-open-icon c-blue-8" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-regular fa-square-plus accordion-state-closed-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></dt>
<dd itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" id="answer-wrapper5" class="collapse multi-collapse ml-3"><div><div class="py-2 px-3">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer5">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) has a recorded net income of $27.82 billion. TSM has generated $6.24 earnings per share over the last four quarters. </p>
</div></div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question6" itemprop="name text" class="expand-question m-0 position-relative"><button class="collapsed py-3 pl-0 pr-4" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#answer-wrapper6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-wrapper6">What is Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's price-to-earnings ratio?<i class="fa-regular fa-square-minus accordion-state-open-icon c-blue-8" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-regular fa-square-plus accordion-state-closed-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></dt>
<dd itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" id="answer-wrapper6" class="collapse multi-collapse ml-3"><div><div class="py-2 px-3">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer6">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing (NYSE:TSM) has a trailing price-to-earnings ratio of 32.19 and a forward price-to-earnings ratio of 28.82.  The price/earnings-to-growth ratio is 0.9.</p>
</div></div></dd>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" class="faq-item-wrapper">
<dt><div id="question7" itemprop="name text" class="expand-question m-0 position-relative"><button class="collapsed py-3 pl-0 pr-4" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#answer-wrapper7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-wrapper7">What is Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's EPS forecast for next year?<i class="fa-regular fa-square-minus accordion-state-open-icon c-blue-8" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-regular fa-square-plus accordion-state-closed-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></dt>
<dd itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" id="answer-wrapper7" class="collapse multi-collapse ml-3"><div><div class="py-2 px-3">
<p itemprop="text" id="answer7">Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing's earnings are expected to grow from $6.97 per share to $8.86 per share in the next year, which is a 27.12% increase.</p>
</div></div></dd>
</div>
</dl></div>
            

